---
// 4.1 — Maintain and govern: community health checklist
---

<div class="gov-wrap">
  <div class="gov-label">REPOSITORY HEALTH</div>
  <div class="gov-grid">
    <div class="gov-item gov-ok">
      <div class="gov-icon">✓</div>
      <div class="gov-content">
        <div class="gov-name">CONTRIBUTING.md</div>
        <div class="gov-sub">How to submit issues &amp; PRs</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="gov-item gov-ok">
      <div class="gov-icon">✓</div>
      <div class="gov-content">
        <div class="gov-name">CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md</div>
        <div class="gov-sub">Community standards</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="gov-item gov-ok">
      <div class="gov-icon">✓</div>
      <div class="gov-content">
        <div class="gov-name">Release process</div>
        <div class="gov-sub">Versioned, tagged, changelogs</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="gov-item gov-ok">
      <div class="gov-icon">✓</div>
      <div class="gov-content">
        <div class="gov-name">Issue response SLA</div>
        <div class="gov-sub">Acknowledge within 7 days</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="gov-item gov-warn">
      <div class="gov-icon">!</div>
      <div class="gov-content">
        <div class="gov-name">Maintainer succession</div>
        <div class="gov-sub">Who takes over if you move on?</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="gov-item gov-warn">
      <div class="gov-icon">!</div>
      <div class="gov-content">
        <div class="gov-name">Deprecation policy</div>
        <div class="gov-sub">What happens if project ends?</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="gov-note">
    An unmaintained rewrite is worse than no rewrite — it creates a false sense of security while bugs go unfixed.
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .gov-wrap {
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .gov-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .gov-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .gov-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  .gov-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    background: var(--bg-primary);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
  }

  .gov-ok   { border-color: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.15); }
  .gov-warn { border-color: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.2); }

  .gov-icon {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
    width: 16px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .gov-ok .gov-icon   { color: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.8); }
  .gov-warn .gov-icon { color: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.8); }

  .gov-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .gov-name {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .gov-sub {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.67rem;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
  }

  .gov-note {
    font-size: 0.83rem;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    padding-top: var(--space-sm);
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-style: italic;
  }
</style>
